// Kernel 2: s_G = absmax(X_rot per group) → write s_G to DRAM
// Kernel 3: X_q = E2M1_quantize(X_rot / s_G) → write X_q to DRAM

// Fused 方法（QuTLASS，1 次 kernel launch + 0 次 DRAM 写入）:
